The scripts in this directory are used for extracting and publishing emulated ACCESS events
per v2 of the Download Service based on legacy authorization event details

Emulated ACCESS events are distinguishable from real ACCESS events such that the access_id
component will have the prefix "xxx_"

The scripts operate on a snapshot of the production sqlite database file, which should be copied
from production

Note that no data stored in this subdirectory include any potentially personal identifying information
and therefore does not require special privacy handling nor does GDPR apply
